1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,100
When a number gets stuck, Math Heroes save the day!

2
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:05,540
Alert!

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:08,420
Three plus two, and it's stuck!

4
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,580
There's no room to add two.

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,380
Let's call a friend!

6
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:16,120
Two's friend is three!

7
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,640
Take away three, then add five!

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,440
Three plus two is five!

9
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,080
Mission solved!

10
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:26,160
Another alert!

11
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,040
Four plus one, and it's stuck!

12
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,300
There's no room to add one.

13
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,340
Let's call a friend again!

14
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,800
One's friend is four!

15
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,460
Take away four, then add five!

16
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,240
Four plus one is five!

17
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:44,940
Heroes win again!

18
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:48,400
Every stuck number has a trick.

19
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:53,720
Learn them all with Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
